  "content": "<span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span>(1) The Central\r\nGovernment may, by notification, and subject to such conditions, limitations and restrictions as may be\r\nspecified therein, delegate any of its powers or functions under this Act other than the power to make\r\nrules to such authority or officer as may be specified in the notification:</br><hr class=\"hr1\"/>\r\n<span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span>\r\n<sup>1</sup>* <span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span>* <span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span>* <span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span>* <span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span><span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span>*</br><hr class=\"hr1\"/>\r\n<span style=\"margin-left:15px;\"></span>\r\n(2) A copy of every notification issued under sub-section (1) shall, as soon as may be after it is\r\nissued, be laid before each House of Parliament.</br><hr class=\"hr1\"/></br>",
